WARNING:Place:619 - This design is using a Side-BUFG site due to placement
   constraints on a BUFG, DCM, clock IOB or the loads of these components. It is
   recommended that Top and Bottom BUFG sites be used instead of Side-BUFG sites
   whenever possible because they can reach every clock region on the device.
   Side-BUFG sites can reach only clock regions on the same side of the device
   and also preclude the use of certain Top and Bottom BUFGs in the same clock
   region.
